@startuml
title OmniTrade AI - UML timing diagram for pause and resume
robust "Run" as Run
robust "Ready batch" as Batch
robust "Checkpoint" as Checkpoint
robust "Event stream" as Events
robust "Agent Room" as UI
@0
Run is Queued
Batch is Idle
Checkpoint is Previous
Events is Connected
UI is Queued
@10
Run is Running
Batch is Executing
UI is Running
@25
Events is Reconnecting
@30
Events is Connected
@40
Run is Pausing
UI is Pausing
@55
Batch is Complete
Checkpoint is Writing
@60
Checkpoint is Durable
Run is Paused
UI is Paused
@120
Run is Queued
UI is Queued
@130
Run is Running
Batch is Executing
UI is Running
@170
Batch is Complete
Checkpoint is Durable
Run is Degraded
UI is Degraded
@enduml
